    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweetness hides behind extreme difficulty!<br>Take control of a cute pudding and escape from the maze of a supermarket and refrigerator. But don\u2019t be fooled by the cute visuals \u2014 this game is no walk in the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls!</strong><br>Drag the pudding to jump!<br>The controls are intuitive, but mastering them is another story. This game will test your patience to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Difficulty, Extreme Challenge</strong><br>Fall once, and you\u2019re back to square one\u2026<br>One wrong move can cost you everything. The tension is real, but the satisfaction of success will make it all worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Charm of Pudding Up Lies in Its Unique Theme and Mechanics</strong><br>The game stands out with its well-defined food theme, where various food characters come to life. The gameplay also introduces bounce ball-inspired items that add a strategic element to the challenge. Mastering the bounce mechanics will help you discover hidden paths and shortcuts. Throughout the game, you\u2019ll also encounter NPCs shaped like different foods. These NPCs will either lend you a helping hand or create unexpected obstacles, adding variety and depth to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Goal: Escape!</strong><br>Your mission is to guide the pudding out of the supermarket and refrigerator. Can you handle the challenge and lead the pudding to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The pudding\u2019s fate is in your hands.</strong><br>Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweetness hides behind extreme difficulty!<br>Take control of a cute pudding and escape from the maze of a supermarket and refrigerator. But don\u2019t be fooled by the cute visuals \u2014 this game is no walk in the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls!</strong><br>Drag the pudding to jump!<br>The controls are intuitive, but mastering them is another story. This game will test your patience to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Difficulty, Extreme Challenge</strong><br>Fall once, and you\u2019re back to square one\u2026<br>One wrong move can cost you everything. The tension is real, but the satisfaction of success will make it all worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Charm of Pudding Up Lies in Its Unique Theme and Mechanics</strong><br>The game stands out with its well-defined food theme, where various food characters come to life. The gameplay also introduces bounce ball-inspired items that add a strategic element to the challenge. Mastering the bounce mechanics will help you discover hidden paths and shortcuts. Throughout the game, you\u2019ll also encounter NPCs shaped like different foods. These NPCs will either lend you a helping hand or create unexpected obstacles, adding variety and depth to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Goal: Escape!</strong><br>Your mission is to guide the pudding out of the supermarket and refrigerator. Can you handle the challenge and lead the pudding to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The pudding\u2019s fate is in your hands.</strong><br>Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
